stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_log: logger.error("Unhandled error:", err)
    q_log --> q_check_env: check NODE_ENV
    q_check_env --> q_respond_prod: NODE_ENV === "production"
    q_check_env --> q_respond_dev: NODE_ENV !== "production"
    q_respond_prod --> [*]: res.status(500) json(error = "Internal server error")
    q_respond_dev --> [*]: res.status(500) json(error = "Internal server error", details = err.message)

    note right of q_check_env
        INV-001: Error details leaked in non-production environments
        INV-002: Default NODE_ENV is undefined (treated as non-production)
    end note
